         "text": "By the product rule and the chain rule, \\( h'(x) = - \\frac{15 x^{2}}{\\left(7 - 3 x\\right)^{2} + 1} + 10 x \\arctan{\\left(7 - 3 x \\right)} \\).",
         "rule_named": "product rule"
      },
